{"4318420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ABOVE", "steam_appid": 4318420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE SKY IS WATCHING.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ABOVE is a narrative-based, atmospheric psychological horror game set entirely in broad daylight.<br>You play as Joyce, a lone park ranger stranded beside her disabled car on a remote desert road in Idaho.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318420/extras/10a96a58972af7dea6cc76e9799689cc.poster.avif?t=1785251284\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318420/extras/10a96a58972af7dea6cc76e9799689cc.webm?t=1785251284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318420/extras/10a96a58972af7dea6cc76e9799689cc.mp4?t=1785251284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The engine is dead. There is no respite. Only temporary shelter, open ground, and the growing sense that something above you is watching, listening, and waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the surrounding landscape, discover pieces of a scattered diary and unsettling radio exchanges that slowly piece together a deeply personal and tragic story about family, guilt, and sacrifice. This is a compact, story-driven experience designed to be completed in a single sitting. ABOVE favors atmosphere, tension, and emotional impact over traditional horror mechanics, asking not how you fight, but how you endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318420/extras/989bbb5b18ee4cba9665e48cb8c962be.poster.avif?t=1785251284\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318420/extras/989bbb5b18ee4cba9665e48cb8c962be.webm?t=1785251284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318420/extras/989bbb5b18ee4cba9665e48cb8c962be.mp4?t=1785251284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist survival experience with environmental fight back mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound-based tension where your actions can attract unwanted attention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration in a wide, open desert with limited and temporary safety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tools that help you observe the environment and sometimes what moves within it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk–reward decisions where being noticed can be fatal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental objectives that require planning, timing, and nerve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle systemic pressure that escalates with every mistake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be completed in a single, intense sitting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318420/extras/affbad111bbc133af6151065c0bdd52a.poster.avif?t=1785251284\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318420/extras/affbad111bbc133af6151065c0bdd52a.webm?t=1785251284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318420/extras/affbad111bbc133af6151065c0bdd52a.mp4?t=1785251284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric psychological horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set during the day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven narrative revealed through exploration and dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound-based mechanics where only specific noises attract danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat: survival through movement, awareness, and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally randomized objectives for replayability</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318420/extras/2f9334685b49dfd453602360c54e2756.poster.avif?t=1785251284\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318420/extras/2f9334685b49dfd453602360c54e2756.webm?t=1785251284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318420/extras/2f9334685b49dfd453602360c54e2756.mp4?t=1785251284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTENT WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains themes of psychological distress, loss, and sacrifice.<br>There is no graphic violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESTIMATED PLAYTIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 1 hour: <u><strong>if you enjoy the game, please don’t refund just because you can!</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic